{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49493","headline":"木兰花 二 · 顾敻","name":"木兰花 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳映玉楼春日晚，雨细风轻烟草輭。\n画堂鹦鹉语雕笼，金粉小屏犹半掩。\n香灭绣帏人寂寂，倚槛无言愁思远。\n恨郎何处纵疎狂，长使含啼眉不展。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}